@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam Shadowing false
title Command execution, undo history and saving
start
:Parse the command;
if (Command requires a roster save?) then (yes)
    :Capture the roster, undo/redo history\nand student-list view;
else (no)
endif
:Execute the command;
note right
  Parsing or execution errors return
  before committing history or saving.
end note

if (Command requires a roster save?) then (no)
    :Log FINE: roster save not required\nReturn the command result;
    stop
else (yes)
endif

if (History action is COMMIT?) then (yes)
    if (Roster is unchanged?) then (yes)
        :Log FINE: no roster changes\nPreserve undo/redo history\nReturn the command result;
        stop
    else (no)
    endif
    :Commit the changed roster to history\nLog FINE: history committed in memory;
else (no, e.g. undo/redo)
    :Keep the history position selected\nby the command without a new commit;
endif

:Save the roster and history together;
if (Saving succeeds?) then (yes)
    :Log FINE: roster and history saved\nReturn the command result;
else (I/O or permission error)
    :Log WARNING with the save exception;
    :Restore the captured roster and history\nRestore the captured student-list view;
    :Throw a CommandException\nwith the save error;
endif
stop
@enduml
